f7d-37\"] mark.kt-highlight{-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;}\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20401_0bc076-5d alignfull kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_c26bc3-74\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_611dc4-df wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_611dc4-df\">2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_6ec408-91\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_5b2a6d-88 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_5b2a6d-88\">Jan<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_dc2989-58\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_680633-00 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_680633-00\">A groundbreaking initiative launches in major cities worldwide, planting 1 million trees to combat urban heat. People celebrate with tree-planting festivals and community picnics.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_913f82-3c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_913f82-3c\">Feb<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_3562e5-1e\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_ee14f6-2e wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_ee14f6-2e\">For Valentine\u2019s Day, a global campaign promotes kindness, resulting in millions of \"random acts of love\" like paying for strangers' meals and writing thank-you notes.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_92f6ce-98 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_92f6ce-98\">MAR<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_5a6f76-b2\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_71f6be-5d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_71f6be-5d\">Scientists announce a major breakthrough in clean energy, unveiling a new affordable solar panel that drastically reduces energy costs for households worldwide.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_556b13-0d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_556b13-0d\">Apr<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_636b14-9e\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_25f75a-c5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_25f75a-c5\">Earth Day celebrations hit a record high as communities in over 190 countries organize beach cleanups, rewilding projects, and renewable energy workshops.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_4c8b97-68 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_4c8b97-68\">MAy<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_8ef896-53\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_192ef3-05 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_192ef3-05\">A world record is set for the largest global reading event, as millions join a virtual book club to read and discuss a novel about hope and resilience.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_9e5a7d-e7 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_9e5a7d-e7\">Jun<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_cd0f5f-c6\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_0c20c1-d9 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_0c20c1-d9\">An international summit on wildlife conservation announces the recovery of several endangered species, including a record number of baby pandas born this year.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_205ce3-13 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_205ce3-13\">Jul<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_d3270f-28\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_a49c3c-7b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_a49c3c-7b\">The first-ever international \u201cUnity Music Festival\u201d takes place simultaneously on all continents, with live-streamed performances promoting cultural exchange and global harmony.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_9fed00-37 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_9fed00-37\">Aug<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_e357de-05\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_10fa98-03 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_10fa98-03\">UNESCO declares 2024 the \"Year of Oceans.\" Countries collaborate on cleaning major water bodies, leading to visibly clearer seas and thriving marine life.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_4eee9c-e2 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_4eee9c-e2\">Sep<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_ffaead-9f\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_4262d6-4c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_4262d6-4c\">A viral global campaign encourages people to write letters to their future selves, sparking waves of introspection and gratitude for life's blessings.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_00b422-4f wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_00b422-4f\">Oct<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_7f697d-bb\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_a2c032-79 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_a2c032-79\">A world food program announces that hunger rates have dropped significantly due to innovative farming techniques and improved food distribution networks.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_1609fe-bf wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_1609fe-bf\">Nov<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_4691d3-4a\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_7edcda-dc wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_7edcda-dc\">The first international \u201cDay of Good News\u201d is celebrated, with media outlets exclusively sharing positive stories about community efforts and global progress.<\/p>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_3e4cc5-2a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_3e4cc5-2a\">Dec<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20401_a3779a-f2\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20401_ebcf7d-37 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20401_ebcf7d-37\">Fireworks and light shows in every time zone celebrate a record year for climate action and international cooperation, leaving the world hopeful for 2025.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>","description":"","image":"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/kadence-cloud-screenshots\/2024\/12\/1734299818_Timeline-2.jpeg","imageW":1200,"imageH":4533,"contexts":[],"hpcontexts":[],"styles":[],"requiredPlugins":[]},"ptn-20458":{"slug":"ptn-20458","id":20458,"name":"Hero 75","categories":{"hero":"Hero"},"keywords":[],"pro":false,"locked":false,"html":"<link rel='stylesheet' id='kadence-blocks-rowlayout-css' href='https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/plugins\/kadence-blocks\/dist\/style-blocks-rowlayout.css?ver=3.5.0' media='all' \/>\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='k