nner-col\"><figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image20370_421c8e-c7 size-large kb-image-is-ratio-size\"><div class=\"kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square\"><img src=\"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/detailed-close-up-of-a-rock-pigeons-head-shot-in-bo-karoo-south-africa.-625410-999x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Detailed close-up of a rock pigeon's head, shot in Bo-Karoo, South Africa.\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-20371\"\/><\/div><\/figure><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-20370_781c4b-14\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_a786a4-2a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_a786a4-2a\"><strong>January 27:<\/strong> Celebrity chef Gordon Ramsay trends after accidentally setting off his fire alarm while livestreaming a \"simple\" cooking tutorial.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_35e769-f0 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_79188d-83 kb-section-dir-horizontal-reverse\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-icon kt-svg-icons kt-svg-icons20370_d2d741-ff alignnone\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-single-icon kt-svg-style-stacked kt-svg-icon-wrap kt-svg-item-20370_7a085d-5c\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fas_dot-circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"  fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_c2d44e-71 rotate-text wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_c2d44e-71\">February 2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_b7d75c-68\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_a7900e-c6 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_a7900e-c6\"><strong>February 3:<\/strong> A live TV blooper during the Super Bowl halftime show sees a mascot trip over stage props, instantly becoming a TikTok sensation.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-20370_ca7e95-ea\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_73d1f9-38 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_73d1f9-38\"><strong>February 22:<\/strong> A photo of a raccoon crashing a red carpet event leads to hilarious edits of the animal as an A-list celebrity.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_4c459c-73\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image20370_d9158c-9d size-large kb-image-is-ratio-size\"><div class=\"kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square\"><img src=\"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/portrait-of-a-raccoon-perched-on-a-wooden-structure-with-a-blurred-green-background.-18001210-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of a raccoon perched on a wooden structure with a blurred green background.\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-20372\"\/><\/div><\/figure><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_eeeef4-42 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_16cd3f-b9 kb-section-dir-horizontal-reverse\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-icon kt-svg-icons kt-svg-icons20370_eb6d79-ae alignnone\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-single-icon kt-svg-style-stacked kt-svg-icon-wrap kt-svg-item-20370_8a09df-95\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fas_dot-circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"  fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_e868fb-bf rotate-text wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_e868fb-bf\">March 2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_33351c-57\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_ec0f25-26 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_ec0f25-26\"><strong>March 5:<\/strong> A trend of AI-generated \u201cwhat if pets had office jobs?\u201d videos floods social media, featuring cats as managers and dogs as clumsy interns.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_1c39e0-23\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image20370_3353ec-bb size-large kb-image-is-ratio-size\"><div class=\"kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square\"><img src=\"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/close-up-of-a-proud-tabby-cat-indoors-exuding-personality-and-charm.-208984-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of a proud tabby cat indoors, exuding personality and charm.\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-20373\"\/><\/div><\/figure><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-20370_26db64-b9\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_005122-3d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_005122-3d\"><strong>March 29:<\/strong> Hollywood actor Ryan Reynolds accidentally tweets his Wordle score instead of promoting his latest movie, sparking a wave of celebrity Wordle flexes.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_8e5cda-ff alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_f906cd-15 kb-section-dir-horizontal-reverse\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-icon kt-svg-icons kt-svg-icons20370_2aefc1-75 alignnone\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-single-icon kt-svg-style-stacked kt-svg-icon-wrap kt-svg-item-20370_c70caa-80\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fas_dot-circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"  fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_84b591-23 rotate-text wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_84b591-23\">April 2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_0279e4-72\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_5180fb-d2 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_5180fb-d2\"><strong>April 1:<\/strong> Twitter (or X?) CEO announces an \u201cedit tweet\u201d feature as an April Fools\u2019 prank, causing mass confusion (and disappointment).<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-20370_2b0cda-00\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_3a36f1-20 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_3a36f1-20\"><strong>April 17:<\/strong> A TikTok challenge called \"Freezer Singers,\" where people record themselves belting out tunes inside refrigerators, takes off.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_62a742-58\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image20370_684d7e-7e size-large kb-image-is-ratio-size\"><div class=\"kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square\"><img src=\"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/young-man-sitting-on-a-freezer-in-a-rustic-garage-adorned-with-vintage-signs.-9060912-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Young man sitting on a freezer in a rustic garage adorned with vintage signs.\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-20375\"\/><\/div><\/figure><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_5896f9-f3 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_b22342-6f kb-section-dir-horizontal-reverse\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-icon kt-svg-icons kt-svg-icons20370_d702e9-7c alignnone\"><div cla