e-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_b0072c-06\"><strong>May 27:<\/strong> Comedians parody the Met Gala by showing up to a spoof event wearing trash bags and pool noodles, dubbing it \u201cTrash Gala 2024.\u201d<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_c063cb-a1 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_ac458b-81 kb-section-dir-horizontal-reverse\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-icon kt-svg-icons kt-svg-icons20370_1ec502-b3 alignnone\"><div class=\"wp-block-kadence-single-icon kt-svg-style-stacked kt-svg-icon-wrap kt-svg-item-20370_82119c-29\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fas_dot-circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"  fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_a73d0e-ca rotate-text wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_a73d0e-ca\">June 2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_ebfd2f-b6\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_50d5d6-07 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_50d5d6-07\"><strong>June 12:<\/strong> A minor coding error on a popular video game accidentally gives all characters absurd dance moves, leading to millions of hilarious gameplay clips.<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-