er 2024<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_877adf-e3\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_7e2117-5f wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_7e2117-5f\"><strong>September 6:<\/strong> A raccoon (yes, the same one from February!) resurfaces after being caught stealing popcorn during a film festival. Fans dub it \"Raccoon De Niro.\"<\/p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_23d5eb-10\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image20370_161264-34 size-large kb-image-is-ratio-size\"><div class=\"kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-square\"><img src=\"https:\/\/patterns.startertemplatecloud.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/cute-raccoon-showing-its-tongue-in-a-natural-setting-perfect-for-wildlife-enthusiasts.-10767665-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Cute raccoon showing its tongue in a natural setting, perfect for wildlife enthusiasts.\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-20380\"\/><\/div><\/figure><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-20370_f98603-c8\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading20370_79d8ea-40 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading20370_79d8ea-40\"><strong>September 28:<\/strong> A fan\u2019s cardboard cutout costume at a Comic-Con accidentally starts a new fashion trend: \"low-budget cosplay chic.\"<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id20370_b45653-0e alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout\"><div class=\"kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-right-golden kt-row-valign-top kt-inner-column-height-full\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column20370_c10ed0-a2 kb